    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_basic_layout" kindref="compound">BasicLayout</ref> simplifies the implementation of JITLinkMemoryManagers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_basic_layout" kindref="compound">BasicLayout</ref> groups Sections into Segments based on their memory protection and deallocation policies. JITLinkMemoryManagers can construct a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_basic_layout" kindref="compound">BasicLayout</ref> from a Graph, and then assign working memory and addresses to each of the Segments. These addreses will be mapped back onto the Graph blocks in the apply method. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
